          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Pearl",
            "ref": "v-pearl"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Morocco”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Why are the buildings painted blue? Some say "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Jews",
            "zh": "犹太人"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "introduced",
            "ref": "v-introduce"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " this "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "practice",
            "ref": "v-practice"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the area. Blue is the colour of the sky. It "
