          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "flowing",
            "zh": "流动的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " water. Mosquitoes don’t like clear and moving water. They like "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "standing water",
            "zh": "死水"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some people may tell you that blue looks cool "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "beneath",
            "ref": "v-beneath"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the high mountain sun. This could be why the practice continues to this day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This all-blue city feels like its own world. Would you like to have a walk there while taking "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "in",
            "zh": "饱览"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " its beautiful "
